WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.700
social publisher. Animated system walkthrough of the documented flow. Animated from the documented pipeline. No account content or model calls shown.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.450
A weekly plan turns topics into dates

3
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Each account gets its own register, never one post reshaped

4
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.950
A voice check blocks em dashes, hashtags, banned words and the wrong register

5
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.300
A person reviews and approves, then the draft is queued

6
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.450
A cron job publishes what is approved, every 15 minutes

7
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.300
Nothing publishes until it passes the voice check

8
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.000
social publisher. System walkthrough of the documented CLI flow. Drafts drawn as placeholders.

